## Pre-open capture timer: Mon..Fri 07:00 Asia/Seoul, before the KRX open.
## Persistent=false: a missed morning is not replayed later — a P-run that
## starts after the open would fail closed anyway (the capture window must
## end before the calendar open), and the S-run's missing seed is the
## honest evidence of the miss. AccuracySec=1s keeps the start time real.
##
## The OnCalendar timezone suffix pins the wall clock to the exchange's
## clock even if the host timezone changes; 07:00 leaves ~2 hours before
## the regular 09:00 open for the universe + daily sweep.
[Unit]
Description=Hong Scanner Pre-open Daily Seed Capture Timer

[Timer]
OnCalendar=Mon..Fri *-*-* 07:00:00 Asia/Seoul
Persistent=false
AccuracySec=1s
Unit=hongscanner-preopen.service

[Install]
WantedBy=timers.target